      "writtenOn": "2022-08-09T12:32:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I suspect that the continuous I2C passthrough requests block the host command\ntask so that the watchdog doesn\u0027t get fed.\nNot sure if changing the payload size makes any difference.",
      "parentUuid": "03ff1a73_546014da",
      "revId": "516c3d23662fd5739ccff6db976785039b22c66c",
