        "id": 1361259
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-10T00:19:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe the issue is mostly when the AP polls for program completion, which is a small transfer that gets repeated frequently. I don\u0027t think I2C performance is a specific issue so much as context switches being very costly (and I2C causes frequent context switches).",
      "parentUuid": "35baf9da_318f5d28",
      "revId": "516c3d23662fd5739ccff6db976785039b22c66c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    }
